{"seq":2,"slug":"bytecode-compilation-specialization","title":"从源码到字节码：编译流水线、dis 反汇编与自适应特化内联缓存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/cpython-interpreter-gil-memory-internals/interpreter-bytecode-execution/bytecode-compilation-specialization","wordCount":2613,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"从源码到字节码-编译流水线-dis-反汇编与自适应特化内联缓存\">从源码到字节码：编译流水线、dis 反汇编与自适应特化内联缓存</h1><p>跨境电商后台里跑着一批 Python 服务：商品标题多语言清洗、汇率换算报价刷新、Celery 里按站点批量改价与生成 feed 的 worker。这些脚本吞吐上不去时，常见处理是换更快的 JSON 库或加缓存——但如果不知道 <code>.py</code> 在 import 那一刻被变成了什么、运行时又被改写成了什么，优化只能靠猜：性能差异可能不来自代码逻辑，而来自某几类指令在第二次执行时是否成功特化。本文覆盖源码 → 字节码 → 运行期改写这条链条（求值循环内部的分发细节见同章 <a href=\"ceval-eval-loop-frame-stack\">求值循环与帧栈</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CPython 里「编译」与「执行」分离且可分别观察：<code>compile()</code> 把源码变成不可变的 <code>PyCodeObject</code>，求值循环再在运行时把其中部分指令<strong>原地改写</strong>成更快的形式。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[源码文本 .py] --&gt; B[tokenizer]&#10;  B --&gt; C[PEG 解析器&lt;br/&gt;Grammar/python.gram]&#10;  C --&gt; D[AST&lt;br/&gt;Parser/Python.asdl]&#10;  D --&gt; E[symtable&lt;br/&gt;作用域与变量绑定]&#10;  E --&gt; F[codegen&lt;br/&gt;伪指令序列]&#10;  F --&gt; G[CFG 基本块&lt;br/&gt;flowgraph.c]&#10;  G --&gt; H[peephole 优化]&#10;  H --&gt; I[assemble.c&lt;br/&gt;伪指令降级 + 跳转定址]&#10;  I --&gt; J[PyCodeObject]&#10;  J --&gt; K[dis 反汇编&lt;br/&gt;静态形态]&#10;  J --&gt; L[ceval 求值循环]&#10;  L --&gt; M[quickening&lt;br/&gt;自适应 → 特化]&#10;  M --&gt; N[缓存命中&lt;br/&gt;近零开销路径]&#10;  M --&gt; O[DEOPT_IF 失败&lt;br/&gt;回退通用形式]\">graph TD\n  A[源码文本 .py] --&gt; B[tokenizer]\n  B --&gt; C[PEG 解析器&lt;br/&gt;Grammar/python.gram]\n  C --&gt; D[AST&lt;br/&gt;Parser/Python.asdl]\n  D --&gt; E[symtable&lt;br/&gt;作用域与变量绑定]\n  E --&gt; F[codegen&lt;br/&gt;伪指令序列]\n  F --&gt; G[CFG 基本块&lt;br/&gt;flowgraph.c]\n  G --&gt; H[peephole 优化]\n  H --&gt; I[assemble.c&lt;br/&gt;伪指令降级 + 跳转定址]\n  I --&gt; J[PyCodeObject]\n  J --&gt; K[dis 反汇编&lt;br/&gt;静态形态]\n  J --&gt; L[ceval 求值循环]\n  L --&gt; M[quickening&lt;br/&gt;自适应 → 特化]\n  M --&gt; N[缓存命中&lt;br/&gt;近零开销路径]\n  M --&gt; O[DEOPT_IF 失败&lt;br/&gt;回退通用形式]</pre><p>每一段在 CPython 源码里都有独立入口，失败也各有其形：语法错误由 <code>Parser/parser.c</code>（由 <code>Grammar/python.gram</code> 生成）在解析期带出位置与建议；作用域问题在 <code>Python/symtable.c</code> 定型，表现为 <code>UnboundLocalError</code>；汇编在 <code>Python/assemble.c</code>（<code>EXTENDED_ARG</code> 溢出、跳转越界都在这里暴露）；而 <code>Python/specialize.c</code> 里的特化不命中<strong>不报错</strong>，只是无声退化为通用路径——最后这一类只能靠观测发现。自 Python 3.12 起，字节码行为写在一套 DSL 中（<code>Python/bytecodes.c</code>），由 <code>Tools/cases_generator/</code> 构建期生成 <code>generated_cases.c.h</code>——执行器、特化器、tier 2 优化器与 JIT <strong>共享同一份指令定义</strong>（见 <a href=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/main/InternalDocs/interpreter.md\">CPython 内部文档 interpreter.md</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"词法-语法与符号表-源码到-ast\">词法、语法与符号表：源码到 AST</h2><p>Python 3.9 起解析器换成 <strong>token 驱动的 PEG 解析器</strong>：语法写在 <code>Grammar/python.gram</code>，用具名规则和 <code>(memo)</code> 标记做记忆化以避免回溯爆炸，对外入口是 <code>Parser/peg_api.c</code> 的 <code>_PyParser_ASTFromString()</code>；AST 节点形状定义在 <code>Parser/Python.asdl</code>。3.14 扩充了编译器诊断：关键字拼错 <code>whille</code> 会建议 <code>while</code>、不兼容的字符串前缀如 <code>ub&quot;abc&quot;</code> 会被拒绝（见 <a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.14/whatsnew/3.14.html\">Python 3.14 更新说明</a>）。3.14 的 <strong>PEP 649 延迟注解</strong>还让注解不再定义时求值，而由编译器放进专门的 annotate function 按需执行——把大量 <code>TypeVar</code> 或 <code>pydantic</code> 模型塞进注解不再拖慢模块导入。往下 <code>_PyAST_Compile()</code> 先调 <code>_PySymtable_Build()</code>：符号表回答「这个 <code>x</code> 是局部、闭包、全局还是内建」，该判断决定生成 <code>LOAD_FAST</code> 还是 <code>LOAD_GLOBAL</code>，而后者直接决定运行时能否特化成近零开销的 <code>LOAD_GLOBAL_MODULE</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"codegen-与-cfg-伪指令-基本块与栈深度\">codegen 与 CFG：伪指令、基本块与栈深度</h2><p><code>compiler_codegen()</code> 通过 <code>ADDOP</code> 系列宏发射指令。关键在于：<strong>这里发出的不是最终字节码，而是伪指令（pseudo-instruction）</strong>。内部文档的原话是它们「类似字节码，但某些情况下更抽象，之后才被解析成真正的字节码」——<code>ADDOP_JUMP</code> 的目标是 <code>basicblock *</code> 逻辑标签而非偏移量，<code>SETUP_*</code> 一类伪指令要到汇编阶段才被拆成真实的异常处理结构。<code>Python/flowgraph.c</code> 随后把指令序列转成控制流图，做 peephole 优化后再降级回线性序列。</p>\n<p>基本块是**「一段总是顺序执行的字节码指令」<strong>，单入口单出口。这解释了优化边界：<code>if/else</code> 会产出守卫块、两个分支体和汇合块，汇合点意味着两条控制流到达同一位置，编译器就不能跨块做「删除冗余加载」这类优化——实际影响是</strong>把热路径写成无分支的早返回，通常比写成一个大 <code>if/elif</code> 链得到更短的字节码**。栈深度分析是硬约束：每条指令对值栈的净影响必须能静态算出，否则帧大小无法确定，<code>dis.stack_effect(opcode, oparg, jump=None)</code> 暴露的正是这套计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"汇编与-code-object-跳转定址与-dis-反汇编\">汇编与 code object：跳转定址与 dis 反汇编</h2><p><code>python/assemble.c</code> 的 <code>_PyAssemble_MakeCodeObject()</code> 把伪指令解析成真实 opcode、把跳转目标从逻辑标签换成相对偏移、构建异常表与位置表，最后打包成 <code>PyCodeObject</code>。指令编码自 Python 3.6 固定为 <strong>2 字节一条</strong>（1 字节 opcode + 1 字节 oparg），参数超过一字节时用 <code>EXTENDED_ARG</code> 前缀，最多三层。跳转语义近几版反复调整，读反汇编前必须确认版本：<strong>3.10</strong> 把跳转参数从字节偏移改为<strong>指令偏移</strong>；<strong>3.12</strong> 把参数改为「相对跳转指令之后紧邻那条指令（即跳过其 <code>CACHE</code> 项之后）的偏移」——向前跳转时 <code>CACHE</code> 项对参数透明、向后跳转时必须计入；<strong>3.13</strong> 起反汇编改为打印逻辑标签 <code>&gt;&gt;</code>，要真实地址时用 <code>show_offsets</code> / <code>-O</code>。</p>\n<p>3.14 新增两个命令行开关，把运行期的特化结果暴露出来：<code>--show-caches</code>（<code>-C</code>）显示 <code>CACHE</code> 项，<code>--specialized</code>（<code>-S</code>）显示特化后的字节码。程序化访问靠三个字段区分「静态形态」与「运行形态」：<code>cache_info</code> 给出 <code>(name, size, data)</code> 三元组，用来看某条指令预留了几个缓存槽；<code>baseopcode</code>/<code>baseopname</code> 给出特化前的通用 opcode 与名称；<code>positions</code> 是 <code>dis.Positions</code>。最后一条实操警告来自官方文档原文：<strong>被填充过的缓存看起来就像任意指令</strong>——对用字节码插桩做 APM 的项目，插桩点必须建立在「从 code object 重新读取、而非缓存快照」的前提上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自适应特化与内联缓存-quickening-的生命周期\">自适应特化与内联缓存：quickening 的生命周期</h2><p>PEP 659 定义的<strong>特化自适应解释器</strong>在 Python 3.11 落地，设计目标是「在小范围内激进特化，使去特化代价低且局部」。实测加速区间是 10%–60%，实验中最高单点约 50%，PEP 自己承认即使只有 25% 也值得做（见 <a href=\"https://peps.python.org/pep-0659/\">PEP 659</a>）。生命周期是四态转移：<strong>通用 → 自适应 → 特化 → 去特化（deopt）</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[编译器发射通用指令&lt;br/&gt;LOAD_ATTR] --&gt; B[首次执行前改写为自适应&lt;br/&gt;LOAD_ATTR_ADAPTIVE]&#10;  B --&gt; C{计数器归零?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[执行通用实现&lt;br/&gt;并递减计数器]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[_Py_Specialize_LoadAttr&lt;br/&gt;查看类型与布局]&#10;  E --&gt;|成立| F[写入特化形式&lt;br/&gt;LOAD_ATTR_INSTANCE_VALUE]&#10;  E --&gt;|不成立| G[推迟特化&lt;br/&gt;STAT_INC deferred]&#10;  F --&gt; H{DEOPT_IF 守卫成立?}&#10;  H --&gt;|命中| I[走快路径&lt;br/&gt;STAT_INC hit]&#10;  H --&gt;|失败| J[回退通用实现&lt;br/&gt;并递减饱和计数器]&#10;  J --&gt;|计数器到底| B\">graph TD\n  A[编译器发射通用指令&lt;br/&gt;LOAD_ATTR] --&gt; B[首次执行前改写为自适应&lt;br/&gt;LOAD_ATTR_ADAPTIVE]\n  B --&gt; C{计数器归零?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[执行通用实现&lt;br/&gt;并递减计数器]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[_Py_Specialize_LoadAttr&lt;br/&gt;查看类型与布局]\n  E --&gt;|成立| F[写入特化形式&lt;br/&gt;LOAD_ATTR_INSTANCE_VALUE]\n  E --&gt;|不成立| G[推迟特化&lt;br/&gt;STAT_INC deferred]\n  F --&gt; H{DEOPT_IF 守卫成立?}\n  H --&gt;|命中| I[走快路径&lt;br/&gt;STAT_INC hit]\n  H --&gt;|失败| J[回退通用实现&lt;br/&gt;并递减饱和计数器]\n  J --&gt;|计数器到底| B</pre><p>两个常数值得记住：预热状态 <code>ADAPTIVE_WARMUP_VALUE = 1</code>，注释说明<strong>特化在指令的第二次执行时就被尝试</strong>（见 <a href=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/main/Include/internal/pycore_code.h\"><code>Include/internal/pycore_code.h</code></a>），另有冷却值 <code>ADAPTIVE_COOLDOWN_VALUE = 52</code> 用于失败后的退避。这解释了一个常被误读的现象：代码只跑一次时看不到特化收益，跑到第二次就开始变了——<strong>基准测试的迭代次数会直接改变被测代码的字节码</strong>。</p>\n<p>内联缓存是这条机制的物质基础：缓存项是紧跟在 opcode/oparg 对之后的若干 <code>_Py_CODEUNIT</code>（2 字节）字，<strong>每个家族的第一个缓存槽永远是计数器</strong>；同一家族的所有成员必须有<strong>完全相同的缓存槽数量</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指令</th>\n<th>缓存结构</th>\n<th>槽数</th>\n<th>存了什么</th>\n<th>特化示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>LOAD_ATTR</code></td>\n<td><code>_PyLoadMethodCache</code></td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>计数器、<code>type_version[2]</code>、<code>keys_version[2]</code>、<code>descr[4]</code></td>\n<td><code>LOAD_ATTR_INSTANCE_VALUE</code>、<code>LOAD_ATTR_SLOT</code>、<code>LOAD_ATTR_MODULE</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>STORE_ATTR</code></td>\n<td><code>_PyAttrCache</code></td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>计数器、<code>version[2]</code>、<code>index</code></td>\n<td>属性写入的内联路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>LOAD_GLOBAL</code></td>\n<td><code>_PyLoadGlobalCache</code></td>\n<td>计数器 + 版本</td>\n<td><code>module_keys_version</code></td>\n<td><code>LOAD_GLOBAL_MODULE</code>、<code>LOAD_GLOBAL_BUILTIN</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>type_version</code> 与 <code>keys_version</code> 是<strong>版本标签</strong>，守卫就是比较它们是否仍然相等。性能模型可写成显式式子：若第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个特化分支执行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 次、耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，未命中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>miss</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{miss}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">miss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 次、单次未命中耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>miss</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{miss}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">miss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>adaptive</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>miss</mtext></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>miss</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>miss</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>Speedup</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>adaptive</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{adaptive}} = \\frac{\\sum_i T_i N_i + T_{\\text{miss}} N_{\\text{miss}}}{\\sum_i N_i + N_{\\text{miss}}}, \\qquad \\text{Speedup} = \\frac{T_{\\text{base}}}{T_{\\text{adaptive}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">adaptive</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4254em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">miss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">miss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">miss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Speedup</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">adaptive</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>一是多态程度决定收益</strong>：属性访问点若在 5 个类之间轮转，每个类型的分支只拿到约 1/5 的执行次数，未命中时还要付出去特化代价，收益会被吃光——跨境系统里典型的多态热点是「同一份 order 对象在不同站点承载不同 schema」，这种设计会让 <code>LOAD_ATTR</code> 长期停留在通用形式。<strong>二是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>miss</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T\\_{\\text{miss}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">miss</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>base</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T\\_{\\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的比值决定值不值得特化</strong>，这也是官方把 <code>LOAD_GLOBAL</code> 称为「近乎理想案例」的原因。3.14 起 <strong>PEP 659 的特化机制在 free-threaded 构建中也已启用</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从特化到-tier-2-与-jit-3-13-到-3-15-的演进\">从特化到 tier 2 与 JIT：3.13 到 3.15 的演进</h2><p>特化解决「单条指令更快」，但不消除分发本身。3.13 引入第二层：把字节码序列翻译成更小的<strong>微操作（micro-ops）</strong>、优化后再由第二个微操作解释器执行——默认关闭（解释更小的操作带来的分发开销超过收益），但为 JIT 提供了输入。<strong>PEP 744</strong> 的 copy-and-patch JIT 编译的正是这份<strong>已被优化的微操作轨迹</strong>：构建期用 Clang 把模板编译成机器码，运行时复制模板并把运行期值打补丁进去，形成一段直线代码。关键数字：运行时组件很小（约 500 行 C，<strong>不依赖 LLVM</strong>，构建期依赖 Clang 的 <code>musttail</code>）；内存开销比基础解释器高约 <strong>10%–20%</strong>；PEP 的转正标准是至少一个主流平台上拿到<strong>约 5%</strong> 的实质性提升——这解释了为什么 JIT 在 3.14 进入官方二进制、3.15 被描述为「显著升级」，却仍标记为实验性。</p>\n<p>与 JIT 平行的是<strong>分发方式本身</strong>。3.14 引入可选的<strong>尾调用解释器</strong>：把每个 opcode 实现成一个小 C 函数，用尾调用互相跳转，而不是在一个巨大的 C <code>case</code> 里分发。构建时用 <code>--with-tail-call-interp</code> 开启，目前只支持 <strong>Clang 19 及以上</strong>与 <strong>x86-64 / AArch64</strong>，且强烈建议配合 PGO；官方初步基准是 <code>pyperformance</code> 套件<strong>几何平均快 3%–5%</strong>。三条结论：版本是字节码契约的一部分，跨版本共享 <code>.pyc</code> 是自找麻烦；收益来自热点，微操作层与 JIT 都只对反复执行的路径生效；可观测性已经跟上——3.15 的 Tachyon 采样 profiler 支持按 PID 无侵入 attach，并用 <code>--opcodes</code> 直接展示<strong>包括自适应特化在内</strong>的字节码级信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>流水线是六段而非一段</strong>：词法 → PEG 解析 → symtable → codegen（伪指令）→ CFG/peephole → assemble（定址 + 异常表），每段在 CPython 源码里都有独立入口。</li>\n<li><strong>伪指令决定优化边界</strong>。<code>ADDOP_JUMP</code> 指向逻辑标签而非偏移，基本块是「总顺序执行」的单入口单出口段——汇合点越多可做的优化越少，这是早返回通常优于长 <code>if/elif</code> 链的结构性原因。</li>\n<li><strong>跳转语义近三版改了三次</strong>（3.10 指令偏移、3.12 相对缓存后指令、3.13 打印逻辑标签），读原始反汇编前必须确认版本。</li>\n<li><strong>特化是四态机</strong>：通用 → 自适应 → 特化 → deopt，预热常数 <code>ADAPTIVE_WARMUP_VALUE = 1</code> 意味着第二次执行就尝试特化；<code>LOAD_ATTR</code> 的缓存是 9 个 2 字节槽，第一槽永远是计数器。</li>\n<li><strong>收益由多态程度决定</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>adaptive</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{adaptive}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">adaptive</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的加权式说明，属性访问点在多个类型间轮转时，去特化代价会吃掉特化收益。</li>\n<li><strong>tier 2 与 JIT 只服务热点</strong>：copy-and-patch JIT 内存开销高约 10%–20%，转正门槛约 5%；3.14 尾调用解释器给出 3%–5% 的几何平均提升。</li>\n<li>关键源码：<a href=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/main/InternalDocs/compiler.md\"><code>InternalDocs/compiler.md</code></a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/main/InternalDocs/interpreter.md\"><code>InternalDocs/interpreter.md</code></a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/main/Include/internal/pycore_code.h\"><code>Include/internal/pycore_code.h</code></a>、<a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.14/library/dis.html\">dis 文档</a>、<a href=\"https://peps.python.org/pep-0659/\">PEP 659</a>、<a href=\"https://peps.python.org/pep-0744/\">PEP 744</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"从源码到字节码：编译流水线、dis 反汇编与自适应特化内联缓存","id":"从源码到字节码-编译流水线-dis-反汇编与自适应特化内联缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"词法、语法与符号表：源码到 AST","id":"词法-语法与符号表-源码到-ast"},{"level":2,"text":"codegen 与 CFG：伪指令、基本块与栈深度","id":"codegen-与-cfg-伪指令-基本块与栈深度"},{"level":2,"text":"汇编与 code object：跳转定址与 dis 反汇编","id":"汇编与-code-object-跳转定址与-dis-反汇编"},{"level":2,"text":"自适应特化与内联缓存：quickening 的生命周期","id":"自适应特化与内联缓存-quickening-的生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"从特化到 tier 2 与 JIT：3.13 到 3.15 的演进","id":"从特化到-tier-2-与-jit-3-13-到-3-15-的演进"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"求值循环与帧栈：ceval 指令分发、帧对象与值栈模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/cpython-interpreter-gil-memory-internals/interpreter-bytecode-execution/ceval-eval-loop-frame-stack"},"next":{"title":"局部变量、异常展开与栈回溯：零开销异常表、trace/profile 钩子与调试接入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/cpython-interpreter-gil-memory-internals/interpreter-bytecode-execution/frame-locals-exception-unwinding"}}